{"overview":"در حالی که ناپلئون بناپارت در البا تبعید شده است، پادشاهان و شاهزاده‌های تاجدار، وزیران و جاسوسان، نجیب‌زنان و معشوقه‌ها، ماجراجویان، مخترعان، هنرمندان و کونبی‌ها در وین گرد هم می‌آیند تا جشن بگیرند و مذاکرات کنند. سرنوشت اروپا در رقص‌پیشانی و اتاق خواب‌ها تصمیم‌گیری می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"While Napoleon Bonaparte is exiled on Elba, kings and crown princes, ministers and spies, noblewomen and mistresses, adventurers, inventors, artists, and concubines gather in Vienna to celebrate and negotiate. Here, the fate of Europe is decided on the dance floor and in the boudoir.","tagline_en":"","runtime":53,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":6,"y":2026,"poster":"/eX6E7u6AicwNsMAZ2lm8zFM8lz2.jpg"}],"episodes":6,"crew":["Hannu Salonen"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["AT"],"cast":[{"name":"Fritz Karl","role":"","photo":"/jvkg9ugmuCjAM4OOQyEmIeiVWn1.jpg"},{"name":"Marlene Tanczik","role":"","photo":"/6qVj3ksOEwSa0vSXC7ItzqFdgFn.jpg"},{"name":"Daniel Donskoy","role":"","photo":"/a7wtm3P5mUnqSGO0HBQ1viGgAUK.jpg"},{"name":"Alexander Scheer","role":"","photo":"/z5t37qxBzEGyRprD8TWFbNbolOP.jpg"},{"name":"Vladimir Burlakov","role":"","photo":"/zIpN4PwIDQSNgUvR2D3cNXYn0Ae.jpg"},{"name":"Erwin Steinhauer","role":"","photo":"/tRrQY9H5EWoxaDzBAb487OjC7bS.jpg"},{"name":"Emma Nova","role":"","photo":"/a0jQjeeIxCQT2eHeFepc80cspI7.jpg"},{"name":"Julia Anna Grob","role":"","photo":"/qMG5G7Q9qglz338cJabOiCo5rWD.jpg"},{"name":"Trystan Pütter","role":"","photo":"/9dQt0NZnD4UGCozxT6C581E9BxU.jpg"},{"name":"Heikko Deutschmann","role":"","photo":"/qVdY5ZwW5FE4c031H2bFDviQJzH.jpg"},{"name":"Corinna Pumm","role":"","photo":"/hYcIxExEnABKGewzO2CtYoDLevo.jpg"},{"name":"Louis-Do de Lencquesaing","role":"","photo":"/rnELz71XUPNUyJZXuyWXIHADM1U.jpg"}],"trailer":"","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/288120-vienna-game/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Disney Plus","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/5eZ872CghnHFLB1j8grszbrx0dx.png"},{"n":"Hulu","kind"